{"componentChunkName":"component---src-templates-series-template-tsx","path":"/series/llm-serving/","result":{"data":{"site":{"siteMetadata":{"title":"dontech","siteUrl":"https://donmain.dev"}},"allMarkdownRemark":{"edges":[{"node":{"id":"fa3a4483-28f7-5360-b471-76fe0769262f","fields":{"slug":"/llm/llm-inference-process/"},"frontmatter":{"title":"Prefill과 Decode로 이해하는 LLM 추론 과정","summary":"Prefill은 프롬프트 전체를 한 번의 forward pass로 병렬 처리해 KV Cache와 첫 토큰을 만드는 단계이고, Decode는 그 캐시를 읽으며 토큰을 하나씩 생성하는 단계입니다. compute-bound와 memory-bound로 갈리는 두 단계의 비대칭이 왜 서빙 최적화의 출발점인지 정리합니다.","date":"2026.07.06.","category":"LLM","series":"llm-serving","seriesOrder":1,"thumbnail":{"childImageSharp":{"gatsbyImageData":{"layout":"constrained","placeholder":{"fallback":"data:image/png;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAABQAAAAKCAIAAAA7N+mxAAAACXBIWXMAAAsTAAALEwEAmpwYAAAAjUlEQVR42mP4TwFgoL7mf/+A6B+M/e/v379wLiHN/8CIbJs/f/n+7PmL9+/ff/78+datW5cuXbp37x7EFbg1g+W+vTy19tDdcxcuP3hw/8mTpydOnJgzZ87JkyeBUkD347EZpPnjh5fn732+fPH8hQsXz507B7Tz7du3z58/J2QziiNQANF+xqmYqvEMALZMS7Wh4IGoAAAAAElFTkSuQmCC"},"backgroundColor":"transparent","images":{"fallback":{"src":"/static/c8f95a34cba948bf9948de785e997e40/ff2cd/thumbnail.png","srcSet":"/static/c8f95a34cba948bf9948de785e997e40/bcf32/thumbnail.png 750w,\n/static/c8f95a34cba948bf9948de785e997e40/ff2cd/thumbnail.png 768w,\n/static/c8f95a34cba948bf9948de785e997e40/475f8/thumbnail.png 1080w,\n/static/c8f95a34cba948bf9948de785e997e40/85c70/thumbnail.png 1200w","sizes":"(min-width: 768px) 768px, 100vw"},"sources":[{"srcSet":"/static/c8f95a34cba948bf9948de785e997e40/3225c/thumbnail.avif 750w,\n/static/c8f95a34cba948bf9948de785e997e40/b7b85/thumbnail.avif 768w,\n/static/c8f95a34cba948bf9948de785e997e40/97eec/thumbnail.avif 1080w,\n/static/c8f95a34cba948bf9948de785e997e40/56c83/thumbnail.avif 1200w","type":"image/avif","sizes":"(min-width: 768px) 768px, 100vw"},{"srcSet":"/static/c8f95a34cba948bf9948de785e997e40/2c6fe/thumbnail.webp 750w,\n/static/c8f95a34cba948bf9948de785e997e40/6571